.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt CAPABILITIES 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm capabilities
.Nd report environment capabilities and service contract health
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints a high-signal report for the current zdots environment.
It checks provider files, critical paths, terminal state, deploy diagnostics,
observability state, AI reachability, and the knowledge layer.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -json
Emit machine-readable JSON.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_OTEL_RESOURCE_JSON
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root. Defaults to
.Pa ~/.config/zsh .
.It Ev ZDOTS_SERVICE_AI
Configured AI provider.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT
AI server base URL.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODEL
Configured model name.
.It Ev ZDOTS_SESSION_ID , Ev ZDOTS_TRACE_ID
Observable shell identifiers.
.It Ev ZDOTS_ENV_PROFILE
Environment profile label.
.It Ev ZDOTS_OTEL_RESOURCE_JSON
OpenTelemetry resource manifest emitted by shell init.
.It Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME , Ev XDG_STATE_HOME
Config and state roots.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width docs/generated/interface-inventory.json
.It Pa .zdots.env
Service composition manifest.
.It Pa providers/*/*.zsh
Provider implementations checked by the contract report.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/zsh/traces.jsonl
Local trace stream.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr agent-guide 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ctl 8 ,
.Xr zdots 7
